@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = customer-mahesh
@conversationId = conv-return-policy

### ===== RAG CHAT ENDPOINTS =====
### Endpoint: /api/rag/chat
### Tests the RAG system with policy documents

### Query 1: Electronics Return Policy - Direct Policy Match
### Expected: Should find that trimmers have a 14-day return window
### The response should cite the 14-day limit for electronics/trimmers
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}-q1",
  "message": "Can Mahesh return a trimmer he bought 20 days ago? What's our return window for electronics?"
}

###

### Query 2: Out-of-Scope Question - Graceful Handling
### Expected: Should politely indicate that cryptocurrency is not a supported payment method
### Should NOT hallucinate or make up payment methods
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}-q2",
  "message": "Do you accept cryptocurrency payments like Bitcoin and Ethereum at SwiftKart?"
}

###

### Query 3: Shipping Timeline
### Expected: Should retrieve shipping policy and mention 3-5 business days for standard shipping
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}-q3",
  "message": "How long does standard shipping take at SwiftKart?"
}

###

### Query 4: Return Personal Care Items
### Expected: Should mention that opened personal care items are non-returnable
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}-q4",
  "message": "I opened a cosmetic product and now want to return it. Is this possible?"
}

###

### Query 5: Refund Timeline
### Expected: Should mention 5-7 business days for refunds
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}-q5",
  "message": "How long does it take to receive a refund after SwiftKart approves my return?"
}

###

### Query 6: Conversational Continuity with RAG
### Expected: Should maintain conversation context and still use RAG for policy grounding
### This tests that memory + RAG work together
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}-q1",
  "message": "And what if it was a regular shirt instead? Would the return policy be different?"
}

###

### Query 7: Express Shipping Details
### Expected: Should mention express shipping (1-2 days) and metros where it's available
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}-q7",
  "message": "What's the fastest shipping option available? Can I get it delivered tomorrow in Bangalore?"
}

###

### Query 8: Delivery Partners
### Expected: Should mention SwiftExpress and BlueDart as carrier partners
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}-q8",
  "message": "Which courier companies does SwiftKart use for deliveries?"
}

###

### Query 9: Order Cancellation
### Expected: Should mention 4-hour cancellation window from order placement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}-q9",
  "message": "I just placed an order 2 hours ago. Can I still cancel it?"
}

###

### Query 10: Support Hours
### Expected: Should mention 24/7 support availability
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}-q10",
  "message": "When can I contact customer support? I need help with my order right now."
}
